# Model binaries are NOT committed to git.
# They are either:
#   (a) sideloaded manually during development, or
#   (b) fetched at runtime by ModelManager via RemoteDownload source.
#
# To install the bundled scene model for local testing:
#   1. Download mobilenet_v3_large_100_224_feature_vector.tflite from TF Hub
#   2. Rename to mobilenet_v3_scene.tflite
#   3. Place at:  app/src/main/assets/models/scene/mobilenet_v3_scene.tflite
#   4. Update sha256 in ModelManifest.default if you want integrity checking

*.tflite
*.onnx
*.pb
*.bin
